+# Contributing
+
+Thanks for contributing to `awesome-best-ai-tools-for-insurance-agents-2026`.
+
+## Submission Rules
+
+- Every submission must include a **public `github.com` repository URL**
+- No closed-source SaaS products
+- No “AI directories” or affiliate landing pages
+- The repo must have a visible license
